{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id27762376"}, "name":{"label":"GrayHawk34"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-29T08:34:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.24.2"}, "id":{"label":"14607587313"}, "title":{"label":"Beautiful. Reduce cognitive drag."}, "content":{"label":"I've tried many task manager apps over the years and never found one that felt like a fit. I admire Todoist for its many powerful features and have made several runs at trying make it work. After spending over a month with Things 3, I've finally found the task manager that works. It has plenty of powerful features and wonderful flexibility and adaptability. But the winning feature is the clean, simple, fresh-looking user interface. Every app designer should take a lesson from Things 3 for how to create an app that decreases cognitive drag. I believe that a high complexity visual experience for in a task manager app (and other apps)  decreases its utility - even creating a barrier to using the app. Things 3 does what a task manager is intended to do - improve my productivity and organization. Many thanks and kudos to these developers.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
