{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id32167808"}, "name":{"label":"Bigstub"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-11T00:48:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.23.1"}, "id":{"label":"14536101769"}, "title":{"label":"Links to Mapquest"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Things for years. Unfortunately, I can’t natively change address links from Apple Maps to MapQuest.\n\nThe best workaround is to create an Apple Shortcut that converts an address into a MapQuest link and inserts it into Things. Then tapping that link opens MapQuest instead of Apple Maps", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1018537353"}, "name":{"label":"Sweetjennay"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-10T10:03:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.23.1"}, "id":{"label":"14533876299"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing app and attentive support"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve had Things 3 on my phone/laptop for two years now and I absolutely love it. It’s super easy and intuitive to use, no other to do list app has worked for my ADHD like this. I can keep my consistent routines in check as well as breaking down little tasks and major detailed multi step projects in an approachable and organized way. I had some problems with the recent update and their support team was so responsive and were quick to find a solution to my problems. I’m so grateful to them and to this app for truly making my life better! Cannot recommend enough", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id14323299"}, "name":{"label":"JonathanWhitman"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-09T23:26:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.23.1"}, "id":{"label":"14532007047"}, "title":{"label":"Still the best"}, "content":{"label":"How doesn’t everyone own this?  I have been using this app for as long as I remember and it still works seamlessly on all my devices without forcing me to pay continuous fees. Keep up the good work!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1774131246"}, "name":{"label":"E.1N"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-08T09:29:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.23.1"}, "id":{"label":"14525895042"}, "title":{"label":"Gorgeous but widget…"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve known about Things for many years, and I’ve tried many different reminder and task apps. I always ended up coming back to Apple Reminders because I was missing something in the alternatives.\n\nSome apps have too much information and too many features, while others are too simple. Things feels like the golden mean for me.\n\nThe only thing I really don’t like is the widget. It’s functional, but I think the list name could either use a slightly larger font or have some extra space below it. Right now, the spacing makes it look a bit cramped and honestly hurts my eyes. It feels a little bit like Android design.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id408945243"}, "name":{"label":"d_jm13"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-05T01:05:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.23.1"}, "id":{"label":"14512673345"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing for me!"}, "content":{"label":"I've hesitated on this app for years because of the price and because most todo apps just do not work at all for me with my adhd. However, this app is incredible! The user interface is so so nice, and it has the perfect balance having just enough features while still being really simple to use with no learning curve! I'm so glad I finally purchased this! However to bring in new people I'd definitely recommend letting people download and try the app for a few days before purchasing to unlock the full version. But I'm so glad I bought it, and so glad it doesn't require a subscription! The one thing which would help me so much, even more, would be if along with today and someday, if you added a \"soon\" or \"priority\" section on the main screen which indicated it needed to be done soon without adding a specific date. Thanks so much for your work on this app!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id33002388"}, "name":{"label":"JSwann5726"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-04T16:38:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.23.1"}, "id":{"label":"14511425127"}, "title":{"label":"Exactly what I needed!"}, "content":{"label":"Things 3 has filled a need that no other app or paper system has been able to fill. It’s as if the developers made this app to my personal specifications. And the bonus is the app is a one-time purchase; no ongoing subscription.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
