{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id27857953"}, "name":{"label":"Rowena Columbia"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-21T12:16:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.23"}, "id":{"label":"14455957196"}, "title":{"label":"Excellent, pay-once app"}, "content":{"label":"I have Things for my Mac, iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch. It works great across all platforms. It’s very intuitive, has tons of useful features, and helps me organize my chaotic life. Even better, it is buy-once. I loathe the subscription trend and really appreciate that Things hadn’t jumped on that bandwagon.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id209841190"}, "name":{"label":"Peterpetrol22"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-20T07:33:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.23"}, "id":{"label":"14451069997"}, "title":{"label":"The absolute best"}, "content":{"label":"Have used this app for over 10 years and tried all the other to-do apps. Nothing compares to the simplicity of this one. I owe a lot of my productivity and organization to this piece of software. \n\nNow that recurring tasks can be checked off before the due date, my life is complete. I’m not a big app reviewer but when I saw that feature included in the latest release I knew I had to write one. Thank you to the team for including that feature: that little change will make a tangible impact on my life.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id890596098"}, "name":{"label":"ara avedian"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-18T16:25:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.12"}, "id":{"label":"14444635994"}, "title":{"label":"Absolutely perfect"}, "content":{"label":"I am a picky reminders app, and this one truly is made with passion and careful thought. Much better than tick tick in functionality and purpose. Everything about it is simple and intuitive, yet powerful. The only thing I wish it had is all the AI power from the new competition and also the interface is a bit slower and less snappy than the competition.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
