{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1536365223"}, "name":{"label":"EvienneK.SEA"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-08T12:10:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"14279148279"}, "title":{"label":"The ADHD Tamer"}, "content":{"label":"This deceptively simple app reshaped my life; being able to break tasks down into lists and set recurring routines has been magical for me.\nBeing able to jot down a thought and process it later (in your inbox) is a game changer.\nI’d buy the software again in a heartbeat!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id167118420"}, "name":{"label":"ONEDIRECTION GAL"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-05T10:19:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"14266787555"}, "title":{"label":"Consistency"}, "content":{"label":"Thinks app allows me to keep detailed task notes in markdown inside the tasks which helps me find the context and key information quickly. \nThings app also allows me to set tasks for work during day and also for the end of the day for my personal time, so, it allows me to not think about personal tasks during the day.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id740874097"}, "name":{"label":"Harry’s Bad Hat"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-05T08:36:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"14266440372"}, "title":{"label":"Close to perfection"}, "content":{"label":"As one of those people who thrives making lists, I love this app! A couple of features I need to bump this up to a 5/5 are ALPHABETIZING and NUMBERING - specifically being able to see how many ✨things🌝 are in a project/list etc. Still really enjoy the way this app looks and functions otherwise", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
