{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id284573642"}, "name":{"label":"Hold on for this ride"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-27T08:30:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"14233225748"}, "title":{"label":"Works great for me"}, "content":{"label":"This app has become foundational to my life. I have four rentals three children, several sources of employment and income. It allows me to keep track of all of them seamlessly- at least for the way I think", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id127457664"}, "name":{"label":"Have ski hfbhaiKbf"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-27T08:19:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"14233186347"}, "title":{"label":"Only Review I’ve Ever Written"}, "content":{"label":"I truly have never considered writing a review for an app. I’m an admin professionally and have spent years testing ways to keep a todo list that didn’t feel like more work. I could never find something easy that somehow cleanly held EVERY todo I have - and here it is! Worth every penny, would buy again and again - my brain has never been happier or less full of junk.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id475820988"}, "name":{"label":"Iv__c"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-27T03:02:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"14232183431"}, "title":{"label":"Great"}, "content":{"label":"After trying multiple planners and task managers, I can confidently say that this one is the best in terms of design and functionality. Clean and not overwhelming, perfect for daily use. I use it as a grad student and it helps me track my daily goals as well as multiple projects.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
