{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id11022771"}, "name":{"label":"joelfreeman3d"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-09T15:31:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"14046788223"}, "title":{"label":"Best of the best"}, "content":{"label":"Things is probably my favorite app ever made on Mac and iPhone. It’s rare to find software of this quality longevity and reliability and I genuinely base my entire life around it. I hope it’s still here in 30 years from now because I intend to keep using it.\n\nI look forward to every update. I’ll be the first line to support the team however I can even after all these years. I keep discovering new features that surprise and delighted, that genuinely improve how I live and work that kind of staying power is almost unheard of. Here’s to many more decades of Things app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id180665389"}, "name":{"label":"TahoeIsGreatGruberIsWrong"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-08T04:16:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.22.9"}, "id":{"label":"14041165700"}, "title":{"label":"Confused"}, "content":{"label":"For costing 80$ across all 3 operating systems, this app should support ALL OS features. Where are dynamic island, live activity, location, and focus filter support?\n\nYou can filter widgets to show tasks with tags. Why can I slo have the whole app filter to only show me selected tags when I’m in a focus mode. Why should widgets be filter able, but the app itself not?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
